00:03:23.713 --> 00:03:24.673
- Yeah, throw some coconut in there.

00:03:24.673 --> 00:03:25.750
- Well, off that tip.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:28.500
- Oh, it's in your shirt now.

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:29.333
- Trinidad.

00:03:29.333 --> 00:03:31.660
- We got chicken on chicken
on chicken on chicken.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:35.070
We go through about three
or four shavings a week

00:03:35.070 --> 00:03:37.640
of about a thousand pounds of chicken.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:39.354
- Five thousand pounds?

00:03:39.354 --> 00:03:40.290
- We get 5,000 pounds of chicken?

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:42.910
- We can't get it out of the
oven fast enough to serve.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.360
- That's a lotta chicken.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:46.380
- And we just dunk it in
there for about six minutes

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.460
